<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en-GB"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><meta name="description" content="Practical technology workshops, knowledge sharing and collaboration space at NovaDot's Leicester office. Open to tech groups and businesses across the UK."><meta name="robots" content="index, follow"><link rel="canonical" href="https://novadot.co.uk/events/"><link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/brand/novadot-mark.png"><meta name="theme-color" content="#fcfbf8"><meta property="og:type" content="website"><meta property="og:title" content="In-Office Events, Workshops &amp; Collaboration Space | NovaDot"><meta property="og:description" content="Practical technology workshops, knowledge sharing and collaboration space at NovaDot's Leicester office. Open to tech groups and businesses across the UK."><meta property="og:url" content="https://novadot.co.uk/events/"><meta property="og:image" content="https://novadot.co.uk/brand/novadot-share-preview.png"><meta property="og:image:width" content="1200"><meta property="og:image:height" content="630"><meta property="og:image:alt" content="NovaDot — Independent systems architecture, custom software, and managed cloud operations"><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"><meta name="twitter:title" content="In-Office Events, Workshops &amp; Collaboration Space | NovaDot"><meta name="twitter:description" content="Practical technology workshops, knowledge sharing and collaboration space at NovaDot's Leicester office. Open to tech groups and businesses across the UK."><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://novadot.co.uk/brand/novadot-share-preview.png"><title>In-Office Events, Workshops &amp; Collaboration Space | NovaDot</title><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Organization","name":"NovaDot","legalName":"NOVADOT LTD","url":"https://novadot.co.uk","logo":"https://novadot.co.uk/brand/novadot-full-logo-hires.png","description":"NovaDot helps UK organisations plan, build, improve and support software, systems and digital services.","email":"hello@novadot.co.uk","telephone":"+44 (0)116 436 1235","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","streetAddress":"First Floor, 18B Tithe Street","addressLocality":"Leicester","addressRegion":"Leicestershire","postalCode":"LE5 4BN","addressCountry":"GB"}}</script><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_astro/ArcGraphic.DOqw_ipj.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_astro/index.B6WbTBL0.css"><script defer src="https://scanner.novadot.co.uk/novadot-analytics.v1.072ff0e7fc53.js" integrity="sha384-5sIvO4uGVSOkyWi+5uhod+c65rFwppXlcnGxsJSiig2jKQ2Vvn8YtmfbDYCnz1CG" crossorigin="anonymous" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" data-site="nd_ne8NN6cbqgvgMTNvcC_zIfoY47NW8pSs" data-routes="%2F,%2Fabout,%2Fcontact"></script>
</head><body><a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to main content</a><header class="site-header" data-site-header><div class="site-header__inner shell"><a class="brand-link" href="/" aria-label="NovaDot home"><img class="brand-logo" src="/brand/novadot-full-logo-footer-transparent.png" srcset="/brand/novadot-full-logo-footer-transparent.png 1x, /brand/novadot-full-logo-footer-transparent-2x.png 2x" width="720" height="280" alt="NovaDot"></a><nav class="desktop-nav" aria-label="Primary navigation"><a href="/">Home</a><a href="/services/">Services</a><a href="/events/" aria-current="page">Events &amp; Space</a><a href="/how-we-work/">How We Work</a><a href="/about/">About</a></nav><a class="button button--primary header-cta" href="/contact/">Discuss your project</a><button class="menu-toggle" type="button" aria-label="Open navigation menu" aria-controls="mobile-navigation" aria-expanded="false" data-menu-toggle><span aria-hidden="true"></span><span aria-hidden="true"></span><span aria-hidden="true"></span></button></div></header><nav id="mobile-navigation" class="mobile-nav" aria-label="Mobile navigation" hidden data-mobile-nav><div class="shell mobile-nav__inner"><a href="/">Home</a><a href="/services/">Services</a><div class="mobile-nav__services" role="group" aria-label="Service areas"><a href="/services/software-ai-business-systems/">Software, AI &amp; Business Systems</a><a href="/services/web-mobile-digital-growth/">Web, Mobile &amp; Digital Growth</a><a href="/services/cloud-security-it-operations/">Cloud, Security &amp; IT Operations</a></div><a href="/events/" aria-current="page">Events &amp; Space</a><a href="/how-we-work/">How We Work</a><a href="/about/">About</a><a href="/contact/">Contact</a><a class="button button--primary" href="/contact/">Discuss your project</a></div></nav><script type="module">var e=document.querySelector(`[data-menu-toggle]`),t=document.querySelector(`[data-mobile-nav]`);if(e instanceof HTMLButtonElement&&t instanceof HTMLElement){let n=[document.querySelector(`.skip-link`),document.querySelector(`main`),document.querySelector(`footer`)].filter(e=>e instanceof HTMLElement),r=e=>{n.forEach(t=>{t.inert=e})},i=(n=!1)=>{let i=e.getAttribute(`aria-expanded`)===`true`;e.setAttribute(`aria-expanded`,`false`),e.setAttribute(`aria-label`,`Open navigation menu`),t.hidden=!0,document.body.classList.remove(`menu-open`),r(!1),n&&i&&e.focus()};e.addEventListener(`click`,()=>{let n=e.getAttribute(`aria-expanded`)!==`true`;e.setAttribute(`aria-expanded`,String(n)),e.setAttribute(`aria-label`,n?`Close navigation menu`:`Open navigation menu`),t.hidden=!n,document.body.classList.toggle(`menu-open`,n),r(n)}),t.querySelectorAll(`a`).forEach(e=>e.addEventListener(`click`,()=>i())),document.addEventListener(`keydown`,n=>{if(n.key===`Escape`&&i(!0),n.key===`Tab`&&e.getAttribute(`aria-expanded`)===`true`){let r=[e,...t.querySelectorAll(`a`)],i=r[0],a=r.at(-1);n.shiftKey&&document.activeElement===i?(n.preventDefault(),a?.focus()):!n.shiftKey&&document.activeElement===a&&(n.preventDefault(),i.focus())}}),window.matchMedia(`(min-width: 960px)`).addEventListener(`change`,e=>{e.matches&&i()})}</script><main id="main-content"><section class="page-hero"><div class="shell page-hero__grid"><div class="page-hero__copy"><p class="eyebrow">Practical Sessions &amp; Tech Community</p><h1>Workshops, collaboration and practical sessions in Leicester.</h1><p class="page-hero__lead">We are developing opportunities for practical technology workshops, knowledge sharing and community collaboration in Leicester. A collaborative environment for founders, engineers, ops directors, and tech groups.</p><a class="button button--primary page-hero__action" href="#host">Discuss an event idea</a></div><div class="page-hero__graphic"><svg class="arc-graphic arc-graphic--compact" viewBox="0 0 620 620" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><g stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25"><path d="M598 76C400 76 238 184 238 316s162 228 360 228" opacity=".16"></path><path d="M598 116C426 116 286 205 286 316s140 188 312 188" opacity=".24"></path><path d="M598 158C454 158 337 228 337 316s117 146 261 146" opacity=".38"></path><path d="M598 201C485 201 392 252 392 316s93 103 206 103" opacity=".62"></path><path d="M598 245C516 245 448 277 448 316s68 60 150 60"></path><path d="M83 316H448" opacity=".5"></path></g><circle cx="448" cy="316" r="7" fill="currentColor"></circle></svg></div></div></section><div class="events-subnav" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><div class="shell subnav-inner" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><span class="subnav-label" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Jump to:</span><a class="subnav-link" href="#upcoming" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Future Sessions (Coming Soon)</a><a class="subnav-link" href="#rooms" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Collaboration Spaces</a><a class="subnav-link" href="#community" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Who It’s For</a><a class="subnav-link" href="#host" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Enquire About Space</a><a class="subnav-link" href="#location" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Location &amp; Travel</a></div></div><section class="section events-section" id="upcoming" aria-labelledby="upcoming-title" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><div class="shell" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><div class="section-heading-grid" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><div data-astro-cid-map3axlu><p class="eyebrow" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Work in progress · Coming soon</p><h2 id="upcoming-title" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Future sessions &amp; workshops</h2></div><div class="section-heading__aside" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><p data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Interested in practical AI, business systems, cybersecurity or software workshops? Tell us which topics would be useful. Session dates, agendas and registration details are currently a work in progress and will be published as soon as confirmed.</p></div></div><div class="events-grid" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><article class="event-card" id="erp-workshop" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><div class="event-card__top" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><span class="event-badge" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Hands-on</span><span class="event-type" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Technical Workshop · Leicester</span></div><div class="event-card__timing" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><span class="event-topic-label" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>ERP Migration &amp; Configuration</span><span class="event-status-tag" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Work in progress · Coming soon</span></div><h3 class="event-card__title" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Mastering ERP Migration: Moving from Legacy Systems to Odoo</h3><p class="event-card__desc" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>A practical, technical walkthrough exploring database mapping, reconciliation checks, bank feed integration, and how to configure standard modules to avoid custom-code bloat.</p><div class="event-card__meta" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><div class="event-host" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><span class="meta-label" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Proposed topic / session:</span><span data-astro-cid-map3axlu>NovaDot Business Systems Team</span></div></div><div class="event-card__action" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><a class="button button--secondary event-btn" href="#host" data-event-title="Mastering ERP Migration: Moving from Legacy Systems to Odoo" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Register interest</a></div></article><article class="event-card" id="ai-meetup" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><div class="event-card__top" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><span class="event-badge" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Discussion</span><span class="event-type" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Community Discussion · Leicester</span></div><div class="event-card__timing" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><span class="event-topic-label" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Practical Automation &amp; AI</span><span class="event-status-tag" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Work in progress · Coming soon</span></div><h3 class="event-card__title" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Bounded AI in Real Business Operations</h3><p class="event-card__desc" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>A practical discussion with regional practitioners examining where automation and AI models deliver proven operational value versus where speculative projects struggle.</p><div class="event-card__meta" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><div class="event-host" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><span class="meta-label" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Proposed topic / session:</span><span data-astro-cid-map3axlu>NovaDot team (open to co-facilitators)</span></div></div><div class="event-card__action" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><a class="button button--secondary event-btn" href="#host" data-event-title="Bounded AI in Real Business Operations" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Register interest</a></div></article><article class="event-card" id="web-architecture" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><div class="event-card__top" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><span class="event-badge" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Engineering</span><span class="event-type" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Engineering Session · Leicester</span></div><div class="event-card__timing" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><span class="event-topic-label" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Modern Web Architecture</span><span class="event-status-tag" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Work in progress · Coming soon</span></div><h3 class="event-card__title" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Modern Static &amp; Edge Architectures for Scalable Web Services</h3><p class="event-card__desc" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Compare static and dynamic website architectures, including performance, hosting costs, updates and ongoing security responsibilities.</p><div class="event-card__meta" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><div class="event-host" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><span class="meta-label" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Proposed topic / session:</span><span data-astro-cid-map3axlu>NovaDot Engineering Team</span></div></div><div class="event-card__action" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><a class="button button--secondary event-btn" href="#host" data-event-title="Modern Static &amp; Edge Architectures for Scalable Web Services" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Register interest</a></div></article></div></div></section><section class="section rooms-section" id="rooms" aria-labelledby="rooms-title" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><div class="shell" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><div class="section-heading-grid" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><div data-astro-cid-map3axlu><p class="eyebrow" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Collaboration spaces</p><h2 id="rooms-title" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Flexible spaces for meetings and collaboration</h2></div><div class="section-heading__aside" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><p data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Tell us your proposed format and group size so we can discuss whether the Leicester space may be suitable. Include any presentation, internet or equipment requirements in your enquiry.</p><p class="aside-access-note" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><strong data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Access notice:</strong> The office is on the first floor and reached by stairs only (no lift).</p></div></div><div class="rooms-grid" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><article class="room-card" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><div class="room-card__header" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><span class="room-badge" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Gatherings &amp; presentations</span><h3 data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Meeting &amp; Presentation Space</h3><p class="room-capacity" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><strong data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Arrangement:</strong> Flexible layout for team and group discussions</p></div><p class="room-desc" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>A practical space for presentations, team alignment, technical talks and community user group discussions.</p><div class="room-features" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><h4 data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Facilities &amp; setup:</h4><ul data-astro-cid-map3axlu><li data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Display screen for presentations and demonstrations</li><li data-astro-cid-map3axlu>High-speed Wi-Fi connectivity</li><li data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Flexible seating arrangements</li><li data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Natural daylight and whiteboard area</li></ul></div><div class="room-ideal" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><strong data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Well suited for:</strong><p data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Tech talks, project demos, team alignment sessions, community meetups.</p></div><a class="button button--primary room-cta" href="#host" data-room-id="meeting" data-room-name="Meeting &amp; Presentation Space" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Enquire about this space</a></article><article class="room-card" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><div class="room-card__header" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><span class="room-badge" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Technical working sessions</span><h3 data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Workshop &amp; Collaboration Space</h3><p class="room-capacity" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><strong data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Arrangement:</strong> Practical workspace for hands-on collaboration</p></div><p class="room-desc" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>A working environment designed for collaborative sessions, architecture reviews, coding walkthroughs and ERP configuration.</p><div class="room-features" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><h4 data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Facilities &amp; setup:</h4><ul data-astro-cid-map3axlu><li data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Work tables with power access</li><li data-astro-cid-map3axlu>High-speed Wi-Fi network</li><li data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Whiteboard space for mapping workflows and architecture</li><li data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Breakout space for informal discussion</li></ul></div><div class="room-ideal" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><strong data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Well suited for:</strong><p data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Technical workshops, workflow mapping, ERP walkthroughs, collaborative reviews.</p></div><a class="button button--primary room-cta" href="#host" data-room-id="workshop" data-room-name="Workshop &amp; Collaboration Space" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Enquire about this space</a></article><article class="room-card" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><div class="room-card__header" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><span class="room-badge" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Focused strategic meetings</span><h3 data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Focus &amp; Discussion Space</h3><p class="room-capacity" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><strong data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Arrangement:</strong> Small-group advisory and planning meetings</p></div><p class="room-desc" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>A quiet room for leadership roundtables, steering committee reviews and confidential project planning.</p><div class="room-features" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><h4 data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Facilities &amp; setup:</h4><ul data-astro-cid-map3axlu><li data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Conference table and seating</li><li data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Screen sharing for remote participants</li><li data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Dedicated space for confidential discussions</li><li data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Whiteboard for strategic planning</li></ul></div><div class="room-ideal" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><strong data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Well suited for:</strong><p data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Steering committees, technical roadmapping, leadership reviews.</p></div><a class="button button--primary room-cta" href="#host" data-room-id="boardroom" data-room-name="Focus &amp; Discussion Space" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Enquire about this space</a></article></div></div></section><section class="section community-section" id="community" aria-labelledby="community-title" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><div class="shell" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><div class="section-heading-grid" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><div data-astro-cid-map3axlu><p class="eyebrow" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Open collaboration</p><h2 id="community-title" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>A tech environment open to everyone</h2></div><div class="section-heading__aside" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><p data-astro-cid-map3axlu>We believe high-value tech progress happens when practitioners, founders, and operators have a neutral space to meet, exchange practical knowledge and compare experiences.</p></div></div><div class="pillars-grid" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><div class="pillar-card" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><span class="pillar-num" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>01</span><h3 data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Founders &amp; Growing Teams</h3><p data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Compare architectural options, discuss system challenges and connect with peers without sales pressure.</p></div><div class="pillar-card" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><span class="pillar-num" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>02</span><h3 data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Engineers &amp; Architects</h3><p data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Discuss real code, frameworks, integrations and deployment patterns with fellow practitioners.</p></div><div class="pillar-card" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><span class="pillar-num" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>03</span><h3 data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Operations Leaders</h3><p data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Gain clarity on ERP choices, data reconciliation, workflow automation and vendor arrangements.</p></div><div class="pillar-card" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><span class="pillar-num" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>04</span><h3 data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Community Organisers</h3><p data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Looking for a Leicester venue for a user group? We welcome community collaboration proposals.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="section host-section" id="host" aria-labelledby="host-title" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><div class="shell host-layout" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><div class="host-info" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><p class="eyebrow" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Event collaboration</p><h2 id="host-title" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Plan a session or discuss space</h2><p class="host-lead" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>We welcome community meetup organisers, user groups, and tech businesses looking for a professional, collaborative space in Leicester. Tell us about your planned session.</p><div class="host-perks" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><div class="perk-item" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><strong data-astro-cid-map3axlu>✓ Community collaboration proposals</strong><p data-astro-cid-map3axlu>We welcome community collaboration proposals. Availability, costs, equipment and any support would be agreed for each activity.</p></div><div class="perk-item" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><strong data-astro-cid-map3axlu>✓ Technical discussion</strong><p data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Work directly with practitioners who understand code, systems, ERP and deployment.</p></div><div class="perk-item" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><strong data-astro-cid-map3axlu>✓ Leicester location</strong><p data-astro-cid-map3axlu>A convenient East Midlands base easily reached via road and rail connections.</p></div></div></div><div class="host-form-wrap" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><!-- Outside a dialog, method="dialog" makes native
             submissions inert even if JavaScript is absent or interrupted. --><form class="host-form" id="event-request-form" method="dialog" novalidate data-astro-cid-map3axlu><h3 data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Space &amp; attendance enquiry</h3><p class="form-subtext" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Submit your enquiry directly to NovaDot. We will discuss suitability and availability before any booking is confirmed. You can also email <a class="text-link" href="mailto:hello@novadot.co.uk" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>hello@novadot.co.uk</a> directly.</p><noscript><p data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Online submission needs JavaScript. Please send your enquiry directly to <a class="text-link" href="mailto:hello@novadot.co.uk" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>hello@novadot.co.uk</a>.</p></noscript><div class="form-honeypot" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><label for="event-website" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Leave this field empty</label><input id="event-website" name="website" type="text" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" data-astro-cid-map3axlu></div><div class="form-row" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><div class="field-item" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><label for="event-name" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Your name <span class="required" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>*</span></label><input type="text" id="event-name" name="name" required maxlength="120" placeholder="First and last name" autocomplete="name" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><span class="field-err" id="err-event-name" data-error-for="name" aria-live="polite" data-astro-cid-map3axlu></span></div><div class="field-item" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><label for="event-email" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Work email <span class="required" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>*</span></label><input type="email" id="event-email" name="email" required maxlength="254" placeholder="name@organisation.co.uk" autocomplete="email" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><span class="field-err" id="err-event-email" data-error-for="email" aria-live="polite" data-astro-cid-map3axlu></span></div></div><div class="field-item" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><label for="event-org" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Organisation or Community Group <span class="required" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>*</span></label><input type="text" id="event-org" name="organisation" required maxlength="200" placeholder="e.g. Leicester Tech Group / Acme Ltd" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><span class="field-err" id="err-event-org" data-error-for="organisation" aria-live="polite" data-astro-cid-map3axlu></span></div><div class="form-row" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><div class="field-item" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><label for="event-intent" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>What is your request?</label><select id="event-intent" name="intent" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><option value="attend" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Register interest for an upcoming topic</option><option value="host-meetup" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Host a community meetup</option><option value="host-workshop" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Run a technical workshop</option><option value="book-room" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Discuss room use for a private team session</option></select><span class="field-err" id="err-event-intent" data-error-for="intent" aria-live="polite" data-astro-cid-map3axlu></span></div><div class="field-item" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><label for="event-room" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Preferred space</label><select id="event-room" name="room" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><option value="meeting" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Meeting & Presentation Space</option><option value="workshop" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Workshop & Collaboration Space</option><option value="boardroom" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Focus & Discussion Space</option><option value="any" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Flexible / To be discussed</option></select><span class="field-err" id="err-event-room" data-error-for="room" aria-live="polite" data-astro-cid-map3axlu></span></div></div><div class="form-row" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><div class="field-item" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><label for="event-attendees" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Estimated attendee count</label><input type="text" id="event-attendees" name="attendees" maxlength="200" placeholder="e.g. 10–20 people" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><span class="field-err" id="err-event-attendees" data-error-for="attendees" aria-live="polite" data-astro-cid-map3axlu></span></div><div class="field-item" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><label for="event-date" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Target date or timeframe</label><input type="text" id="event-date" name="targetDate" maxlength="200" placeholder="e.g. Mid November / Flexible" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><span class="field-err" id="err-event-date" data-error-for="targetDate" aria-live="polite" data-astro-cid-map3axlu></span></div></div><div class="field-item" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><label for="event-details" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Event summary / Topic outline</label><textarea id="event-details" name="details" rows="3" maxlength="5000" placeholder="Tell us about the topic, format, equipment needs, or questions you have..." data-astro-cid-map3axlu></textarea><span class="field-err" id="err-event-details" data-error-for="details" aria-live="polite" data-astro-cid-map3axlu></span></div><div class="field-item form-privacy-box" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><label class="checkbox-label" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><input type="checkbox" id="event-privacy" name="privacy" required data-astro-cid-map3axlu><span data-astro-cid-map3axlu>I understand NovaDot will use these details to assess and respond to this event enquiry. See our <a href="/privacy-policy/" class="text-link" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Privacy Policy</a>.</span></label><span class="field-err" id="err-event-privacy" data-error-for="privacy" aria-live="polite" data-astro-cid-map3axlu></span></div><button type="submit" class="button button--primary host-submit-btn" id="event-submit-btn" disabled data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Submit event enquiry</button><div class="form-feedback" id="host-form-feedback" data-form-feedback role="status" aria-live="polite" tabindex="-1" hidden data-astro-cid-map3axlu><h4 data-feedback-heading data-astro-cid-map3axlu></h4><p id="host-feedback-text" data-feedback-message data-astro-cid-map3axlu></p><div class="form-feedback__actions" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><button type="button" class="button button--secondary" data-new-enquiry hidden data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Start a separate enquiry</button></div></div></form></div></div></section><section class="section location-section" id="location" aria-labelledby="location-title" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><div class="shell" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><div class="section-heading-grid" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><div data-astro-cid-map3axlu><p class="eyebrow" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Location &amp; logistics</p><h2 id="location-title" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Getting to NovaDot</h2></div><div class="section-heading__aside" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><p data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Conveniently situated in Leicester, our office connects easily to transport links across the Midlands and the wider UK.</p></div></div><div class="location-cards" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><div class="loc-card" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><span class="loc-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>📍</span><h3 data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Office Address</h3><p data-astro-cid-map3axlu><strong data-astro-cid-map3axlu>NOVADOT LTD</strong></p><p data-astro-cid-map3axlu>First Floor, 18B Tithe Street, Leicester, LE5 4BN</p><div class="access-notice" role="note" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><strong data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Access notice:</strong><p data-astro-cid-map3axlu>The office is on the first floor and is reached by stairs only; there is no lift. Please discuss access requirements with us before arranging a visit.</p></div><p class="loc-note" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Meetings and events strictly by confirmed booking or registration.</p></div><div class="loc-card" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><span class="loc-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>🚆</span><h3 data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Rail Connections</h3><p data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Plan your journey to Leicester station using National Rail or travel planners, and check local onward connections to Tithe Street.</p><p class="loc-subtext" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Direct train services run to Leicester from London St Pancras, Birmingham New Street, Nottingham, Derby and Sheffield. Please check live timetables for current journey details.</p></div><div class="loc-card" data-astro-cid-map3axlu><span class="loc-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-map3axlu>🚗</span><h3 data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Visiting &amp; Travel</h3><p data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Easily accessible from the M1 and Leicester central road network (A47 / St Peters Way).</p><ul data-astro-cid-map3axlu><li data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Please ask about parking arrangements when planning a visit.</li><li data-astro-cid-map3axlu>First floor premises reached by stairs only (no lift).</li><li data-astro-cid-map3axlu>Sessions and visits arranged in advance only.</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class="closing-cta"><svg class="arc-graphic arc-graphic--compact closing-cta__arc" viewBox="0 0 620 620" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><g stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25"><path d="M598 76C400 76 238 184 238 316s162 228 360 228" opacity=".16"></path><path d="M598 116C426 116 286 205 286 316s140 188 312 188" opacity=".24"></path><path d="M598 158C454 158 337 228 337 316s117 146 261 146" opacity=".38"></path><path d="M598 201C485 201 392 252 392 316s93 103 206 103" opacity=".62"></path><path d="M598 245C516 245 448 277 448 316s68 60 150 60"></path><path d="M83 316H448" opacity=".5"></path></g><circle cx="448" cy="316" r="7" fill="currentColor"></circle></svg><div class="shell closing-cta__inner"><h2>Have an event or workshop in mind?</h2><p>Speak directly with our team to discuss suitability, dates and collaboration arrangements.</p><a class="button button--primary" href="/contact/">Discuss an event idea</a></div></section></main><footer class="site-footer" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><div class="shell footer-grid" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><div class="footer-brand" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><a class="brand-link" href="/" aria-label="NovaDot home" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><img class="brand-logo" src="/brand/novadot-full-logo-dark-theme.png" srcset="/brand/novadot-full-logo-dark-theme.png 1x, /brand/novadot-full-logo-dark-theme-2x.png 2x" width="720" height="280" alt="NovaDot" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if></a><p data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>NovaDot helps UK organisations plan, build, improve and support software, systems and digital services.</p></div><div class="footer-links" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><div data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><h2 data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Work</h2><a href="/services/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Services</a></div><div data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><h2 data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Company</h2><a href="/events/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Events &amp; Space</a><a href="/how-we-work/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>How We Work</a><a href="/about/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>About</a></div><div data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><h2 data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Contact</h2><a href="/contact/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Contact</a></div><div data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><h2 data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Legal</h2><a href="/privacy-policy/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Privacy Policy</a><a href="/terms/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Terms</a></div></div></div><div class="shell footer-legal" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><p data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>© 2026 NOVADOT LTD. Registered in England and Wales. Company number 07691369.</p></div></footer></body></html><script type="module" src="/_astro/index.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.tGDcAizy.js"></script>